    <item>
      <title>First Post</title>
      <link>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/first-post/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/first-post/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Here’s my first post.&#xA;Now I want to change something here to see if the &lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;hard reset&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt; of the local branch to match the remote has gone well.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;reset&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;--hard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;origin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;optional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#960050;background-color:#1e0010&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;clean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;-fd&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;git clean -fd&lt;/strong&gt; removes all untracked files and directories from your working directory.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The listed folders (assets/, data/, i18n/, layouts/) were &lt;strong&gt;not tracked by git&lt;/strong&gt; (i.e., not part of any commit).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;After this, those folders are &lt;strong&gt;deleted locally&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/images/sky_quad.png&#34; alt=&#34;some quad sky image&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/images/dino_quad_small.png&#34; alt=&#34;dino quad image&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Getting to Know the Ananke Theme</title>
      <link>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/explore-ananke/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/explore-ananke/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-ananke&#34;&gt;What is Ananke?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ananke is a popular theme for &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io&#34;&gt;Hugo&lt;/a&gt;, designed to be fast, flexible, and easy to use. It supports a beautiful hero image, post listing grid, and is responsive by default.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ananke-theme.netlify.app/&#34;&gt;Ananke Theme Demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/theNewDynamic/gohugo-theme-ananke#configuration&#34;&gt;Theme Configuration Options&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;how-to-customize&#34;&gt;How to Customize&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Edit the &lt;code&gt;[params]&lt;/code&gt; in your &lt;code&gt;config.toml&lt;/code&gt; file to change the hero image, subtitle, colors, and more!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-toml&#34; data-lang=&#34;toml&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;[&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;params&lt;/span&gt;]&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;hero_image&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;/my-ananke-project/images/hero.jpg&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;hero_subtitle&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Learning Hugo the Fun Way!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Want to tweak the homepage and card layouts?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Explore the theme’s example site in the repo:&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/theNewDynamic/gohugo-theme-ananke/tree/master/exampleSite&#34;&gt;https://github.com/theNewDynamic/gohugo-theme-ananke/tree/master/exampleSite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>What is Hugo?</title>
      <link>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/hugo-introduction/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gitana19.github.io/my-ananke-project/posts/hugo-introduction/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;hugo-static-sites-made-simple&#34;&gt;Hugo: Static Sites Made Simple&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hugo is a blazing-fast, open source static site generator written in Go.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;key-features&#34;&gt;Key Features&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Simple content structure&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Instant builds (great for deploying to GitHub Pages)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Powerful theming system (like Ananke!)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;useful-links&#34;&gt;Useful Links&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/documentation/&#34;&gt;Hugo Official Docs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/getting-started/quick-start/&#34;&gt;Getting Started with Hugo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Try running:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo new site my-ananke-project&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;hugo server&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;to preview your site locally!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
